<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech bank to propose CZK101 96 gross div.</title>
<headline>Czech bank to propose CZK101 96 gross div.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Komercni Banka a.s., the largest Czech commercial bank, on Monday said it would propose paying a 101 crown per share gross dividend for 1996 at a shareholders meeting on May 26.</p>
<p>Komercni paid a 95 crown per share gross dividend for 1995.</p>
</text>
